# oracle: compute pressure with the pair/hybrid keyword: the virial of one sub-style of pair_style hybrid/overlay (lj/cut and morse), with no tail term, alone and together with ke; the whole pair virial and the thermo pressure as well (native switches the hybrid to per-sub-style virial tallies)
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             type 1 type/fraction 2 0.4 4242
mass            * 1.0
variable        dx atom 0.04*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.04*cos(0.9*y-1.1*z)
variable        dz atom 0.04*sin(1.7*z+0.5*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
velocity        all create 1.2 87287 loop geom
pair_style      hybrid/overlay lj/cut 2.5 morse 2.0
pair_coeff      * * lj/cut 1.0 1.0
pair_coeff      1 2 morse 0.3 2.0 1.1
pair_coeff      2 2 morse 0.2 2.2 1.05
pair_modify     tail yes
fix             1 all nve
compute         plj all pressure NULL pair/hybrid lj/cut
compute         pmo all pressure thermo_temp ke pair/hybrid morse
compute         ppair all pressure NULL pair
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press c_plj c_pmo c_ppair c_plj[1] c_plj[4] c_pmo[6]
thermo_modify   norm no format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             50
